Child [smile]: One for the shell and two for the ash, #line:ch02_bark_lane_001 #sung
Child [smile]: three for the bell and four for the hush... #line:ch02_bark_lane_002 #sung
Rhen [neutral]: What comes after four? #line:ch02_bark_lane_003
Child [neutral]: You start again. Everybody knows that. #line:ch02_bark_lane_004
